    <item>
      <title>MultCloud大漏洞，兑换码可无限使用</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2487606</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2487606</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 17:41:35 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/9/9/1/9915d6d892dad722906561bab91b2ac2fe9a963b.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/lQfQhNlG9awYQmA8NZv8AEOKzgv.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/9/1/9915d6d892dad722906561bab91b2ac2fe9a963b_2_690x306.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;lQfQhNlG9awYQmA8NZv8AEOKzgv&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;306&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/9/1/9915d6d892dad722906561bab91b2ac2fe9a963b_2_690x306.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/9/1/9915d6d892dad722906561bab91b2ac2fe9a963b_2_1035x459.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/9/1/9915d6d892dad722906561bab91b2ac2fe9a963b_2_1380x612.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;324579&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
这是一个 &lt;strong&gt;多云存储管理平台&lt;/strong&gt;，支持&lt;strong&gt;云盘之间直接传输、同步、备份&lt;/strong&gt;文件，下面是白嫖方法&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;打开 MultCloud 官网：&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://app.multcloud.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://app.multcloud.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;注册并登录后，在页面右上角找到 &lt;strong&gt;钥匙图标&lt;/strong&gt;，输入：&lt;strong&gt;SHAREWARE06ONSAL&lt;/strong&gt;，领取一年的 &lt;strong&gt;1年 Premium 高级版权限&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;还有一个&lt;strong&gt;官方赠送活动&lt;/strong&gt;（3个月 Premium + 200GB），代码是 &lt;strong&gt;BAAYK667N5K3K0N6&lt;/strong&gt;，但是这个兑换码有个bug，就是可以无限使用，然后流量&lt;strong&gt;每次&lt;/strong&gt;就能加200GB，但是不确定会员会不会叠加。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/6/2/3/6233144b6e77d18eab4682e30622863ba873b511.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/e0Iec4K8QVUaytZxiDEag2wxZPb.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;479x327&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/6/2/3/6233144b6e77d18eab4682e30622863ba873b511.png&quot; alt=&quot;479x327&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;e0Iec4K8QVUaytZxiDEag2wxZPb&quot; width=&quot;479&quot; height=&quot;327&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/7/8/6/78628dbe2c2ab64f98c15d8c70fea1ee99cacd10.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/haYrHi5aL8SfCagnQcNK036XSRW.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;3&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/7/8/6/78628dbe2c2ab64f98c15d8c70fea1ee99cacd10_2_647x500.png&quot; alt=&quot;3&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;haYrHi5aL8SfCagnQcNK036XSRW&quot; width=&quot;647&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/7/8/6/78628dbe2c2ab64f98c15d8c70fea1ee99cacd10_2_647x500.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/7/8/6/78628dbe2c2ab64f98c15d8c70fea1ee99cacd10.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/7/8/6/78628dbe2c2ab64f98c15d8c70fea1ee99cacd10.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;D4C7DF&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/9/3/3932b9b53fa6cb84260c700656113ddc35851eae.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;89ZTszJ7qBq5ERsEEphiEtaWcSW&quot; width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;85&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/2/3/5/235424d46dc19a1c5bc63344df9e68dd648b7cfa.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;52wZjcWHYPdBkU2WFESdQn8ygUq&quot; width=&quot;174&quot; height=&quot;65&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;
貌似可以无限刷？&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;最新发现&lt;/strong&gt;:两个兑换码可以重复交替使用，猜测是交替使用时后一个码会把前一个码的订阅状态顶掉&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;39 个帖子 - 30 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2487606&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
