&lt;li&gt;APA&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;F-Droid. (2026, June 27). The FamilyMart Rice Ball Model: A cross-platform arbitrage system centered on mobile phone bill utilization [Forum post]. LLINUX DO. Retrieved from https://linux.do/t/topic/2486940&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
